* CABSRT01 - PRESORT BY OCN/BAN/SEQ BEFORE DUPLICATE CHECKING
* USED WHEN CABING03 (DEDUP) IS RERUN STANDALONE - THE HEADER
* ON CABING03 REQUIRES THE INPUT BE PRESENTED IN THIS ORDER ON
* EVERY RERUN.  DO NOT REMOVE THE INCLUDE - SEE BELOW.
*
* THE INCLUDE COND ALSO DROPS RECORD TYPES OUTSIDE 01-08 AND
* DROPS ANY RECORD WHOSE SOURCE SYSTEM CODE IS NOT ON THE
* APPROVED LIST (03=EMI GATEWAY, 05=CRIS FEED, 07=MEDIATION).
* THIS FILTER EXISTS ONLY HERE - IT IS NOT CODED IN ANY OF THE
* CABING PROGRAMS.  IF A NEW SOURCE SYSTEM IS ONBOARDED THE
* CODE MUST BE ADDED TO THE INCLUDE BELOW OR ITS RECORDS ARE
* SILENTLY DROPPED WITH NO SUSPENSE ENTRY AND NO ERROR.
 SORT FIELDS=(5,4,CH,A,9,13,CH,A,22,9,CH,A)
 INCLUDE COND=(1,2,CH,GE,C'01',AND,1,2,CH,LE,C'08',AND,
               45,2,CH,EQ,C'03',OR,
               45,2,CH,EQ,C'05',OR,
               45,2,CH,EQ,C'07')
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=200
